    "biography": "<p>Huge, slow, six-legged beasts with flattish horned heads and a splayed beak, covered in a thick horny hide.</p><p>It fights only if attacked. Brought to exactly 1 or 0 hit points, it is subdued and an animal trainer can domesticate it. Its hide, cut from the living animal and regrown in two weeks, is processed into Chlén-hide, the near-iron material of most arms and armour on Tékumel. Tamed Chlén pull carts slowly.</p>",
